  "description": "Entity Framework Core persistence provider for Feedemy.KeyManagement. Provides SQL Server storage for key metadata, versions, labels, endorsements, idempotency records and the hash-chained audit log; the schema comes from the core package's host-run DatabaseMigrator.",
